I took my orcish ranger below minetown after happily find a randomly
generated CoMR in a shop only to discover two graves!  One was for Puni
or Pini, one was for Overdrive.  (This is on NAO).  At first I thought
it weird that they had hardly anything on their graves.  After all, how
do you get that far with so little stuff?  DFV?

Then I encountered two named mummies: Donna and Nestorix.  I thought
"Wow, one of these players had two super powered mummies and still
died?  How did *that* happen?"  But I just recently realized that Donna
and Nestorix are players too and they came back as mummies!

And I want you two to know, if you read this, that your mummies put up
one heck of a fight.  It took most of my stack of daggers to kill those
mummies.  Then I found all sorts of loot on the mummies!  Yay!

Turns out there were 3 wizards and a valk.  Now my random CoMR doesn't
look so special, especially since one of the CoMR was +3, but I also
got lots of nice stuff and a second BoH.  And this is the first tiime
I've found such a large bones file.  Thanks everyone!



